bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Reading History Page (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control ChapterController
control ChapterService
entity ":HistoryModel" as HistoryModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open reading history
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /history/user/:userId
activate Router

Router -> ChapterController: 3. getReadingHistoryListByUser(userId)
activate ChapterController

ChapterController -> ChapterController: 4. Parse userId & convert ObjectId
activate ChapterController
space
deactivate ChapterController

ChapterController -> ChapterService: 5. getReadingHistoryListByUser(user_id)

activate ChapterService
ChapterService -> HistoryModel: 6. Find history by user_id
activate HistoryModel

HistoryModel -> MongoDB: 7. find({ user_id })
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> HistoryModel: 8. History documents
deactivate MongoDB
HistoryModel --> ChapterService: 9. Return history list
deactivate HistoryModel
ChapterService --> ChapterController: 10. Return history list
deactivate ChapterService

ChapterController --> Router: 11. HTTP response
deactivate ChapterController

Router --> UI: 12. Reading history data
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 13. Display reading history
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
